: anywhere;\">ᠳᢠᡡᡑᠽᢋᡓᡝᠻᠰᢓᡞᢥᢒᢁᢋᢦᡜᢟᠦᢢᡐᢋᡝᡝᡏᢜᠮᡐᠧᡭᢏᠦᢟᡭᠵᠰᠼ᠀᠒ᡕᠽᢁᢦᡯᡮᢡᡯᡙ</div>"},{"id":"marker236","name":"Adrozdur Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳁⳐ⳪Ⳋ⳥ⳚⳀⳆ⳥ⳞⳔⳔⳲⲶⳎⳜ⳧⳪Ⳕ⳪ⳬⳔⳈ ⳹ⳐⳈⳆⳘⳐⳠⳲ ⳎⳆⲶ⳾ⲴⳠ⳾ⳞⳔ⳹ⳁⳘⳲⲲⳃⳌⳒ⳥ⳚⲾⳬⳃ</div>"},{"id":"marker237","name":"Drog Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc05\ud802 \udc1d\udc2e\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠬\udc11\udc08 \ud802𐠗\udc31\udc22\udc1a\udc35𐠒\ud802𐠅\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc35\ud802\ud802𐠝\ud802𐠧</div>"},{"id":"marker238","name":"Shotarar Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc11\udc10\udc05\ud802𐠈\udc14\ud802𐠢\ud802𐠠\udc1e \udc38\udc23\ud802𐠬\ud802\ud802𐠤\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠛\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠨𐠛\ud802𐠞\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802  \ud802𐠥\ud802\ud802𐠳\udc24\ud802𐠧\ud802 \ud802𐠮\ud802𐠚\udc37 \udc38\ud802𐠯\udc32\udc2e\udc27𐠞\udc20\ud802 \udc0d\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker239","name":"Soz'jaz Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡝᠻ᠑ᢂᢒᠿᢥᠽᡙᠨᡖᡏᢡᠡᡖᢂᠻᡐᡡᠩᡝᡯᡎᠻᠪᠿᡙᠯᢒᠽᢤᠯᡴᢜᡔᡞᠠᢡ᠀ᢋᢤᡗᡔᢒ᠑ᠮᡟᢢᠡᠿᡴᡠᢞᢓ᠑ᡙᡠᠯ᠐ᡙ᠑ᠵᠿᠮᠾᡰᢜᡑᢤᢢᢞᡯᡯᠰ᠀ᢞᡒ</div>"},{"id":"marker240","name":"Bugbig Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠡᡜᡐᡱᡮᢟᠮᢥᢥᡐᠦᠿᠻᡯᢐᡑᢑᡡᢓᡜᡟᢋᠻᠨᠯᠵᢜᢓᠲᢐᡎᠾᡙᠱᠵᡕᡞᢞᡴᡓᠰ᠑ᢞᢢᡯᠳᢏᢠᡕᡴᢢ᠀ᢐᡭᢦᢟᢞᡳᠳᢀᢓᢟᢋᡏᢢᡯᢑᡔᢡᠳᡙᡳᠱ᠒ᡴᡍᡡᠯᠮᡖᡲᢤᡭᡁᠳᡏᢁᡖᢟᢀ</div>"},{"id":"marker241","name":"Coclif Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ኀተሠሠቀገሐፐነዘአሐተለሰነመደከጸፈሠረነመሠቀተበረለገሰተመጠወገሀሀሀጰተለዐጸነከወየመረ ጰአነፐለ ጠፈየ</div>"},{"id":"marker242","name":"Lintabi Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠱𐠳\udc3c\udc19𐠠\udc28 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠊\udc0b\udc2d\udc11\ud802𐠞\ud802\ud802𐠴𐠂𐠦\udc1f\udc37\ud802 \udc0e \ud802\ud802𐠱 \udc11𐠂\udc0a\ud802𐠨\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠂\ud802𐠥\ud802𐠫\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠏\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠭\udc37\ud802\ud802𐠼\udc28 \udc0e𐠬\udc05\udc34\ud802\ud802𐠋\ud802 𐠒</div>"},{"id":"marker243","name":"Rraler Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc2e𐠓\udc11\udc2d𐠣\udc13\udc19\udc26\udc0a\ud802𐠥𐠑\udc12\ud802\ud802𐠎𐠨\udc03\ud802\ud802𐠳 \udc35\udc1b\ud802𐠈\udc1f\udc35\udc10\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠍\udc12\udc38\ud802𐠞\udc2d\udc23\ud802𐠤\udc31𐠂𐠜 𐠪𐠌\udc2f\ud802𐠣\ud802 </div>"},{"id":"marker244","name":"Qidror Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༂༕༸༿༇༉༪༧༉༑༥༻༿༛༼༤༒༺༈༇༃༹༱༺༉༑༐༦༉་༶༽༑༚༊༹༘༘༷༡༽༷༅༆༡༵༕༳༈༌༳༩༅༶༤༃༦༷༢༁༬༒༸༻༰༺༴༷༜༜༣༙༊༘༊༃༴༪༇༙༘༄༈༮༜༲༯</div>"},{"id":"marker245","name":"Shundi Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ገቀነሰተ ከወከሰጠሠደተኀፀዘደወሠቀገ ረዐዘበጸደጸፀመለፀዐአበገ ነአለፀፀበኀገሰወ ፈሀተፀየለፈፀፀገሠከአሀደ ሰጸከወሰአ ቀ  ተኀሠቀሠቀቀኀከ ፐጠአኀኀደሀከተሐ</div>"},{"id":"marker246","name":"Bag-Gag Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠽᢠᡜᡟᠦᢛᡝᡭᠠᠾᢜᡗᢠᠼᡕᡍᢐᡳᢂᠪᠩᠨᢦᡍᠼᢥᢟᡡᡀᡗᢟᢛᠪᢋᡖᡎᡡᢋᡜᢁᡓᠠᡏᠻ᠑ᢡᢜᢓᡀᢀ᠑᠒᠀ᡝᠵᠲᡝᠯᠳᡕᠱᡗᡜᡔᢜᡭᢑ᠒ᡔᡞᡟᢓᢂᡏ᠒ᡎᡗᢏᠾᠻᡞᠯᡡᢠᠯ</div>"},{"id":"marker247","name":"Kenton Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡙᠦᢞᠳᡓᡴᡲᢀᠠᢏᡍᢜᡗᢓᢏᢏᠳᢏᢠᡁᡳᢥᡟᡯᢟᡳᢁᠾᠾᠡᡜ᠀᠒ᢛ᠀᠐ᢓᠨᠨᡯᢋ᠒ᢢᠾᠨ᠐᠑ᠳᢞᡒ</div>"},{"id":"marker248","name":"Narbiz Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༅༹༻༴༌༤༦༜༲༒༺༒༚༘༯༽༨༉༷༊༂༰༣༷༳༣༡༪༷༗༌༬༾༿༼༸༊༾༂༆༇༙༧༾༹༡༢༕༘༄༴༗༜༦༒༱༂༈༖ༀ༒༘༆༺༸༄༰༠༫༳༿༇༽༕༌༯༴༗༜</div>"},{"id":"marker249","name":"Gazd Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc33\udc29\udc04\udc1e\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠋𐠈𐠔\udc12\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠙 \udc27\udc04\ud802\ud802𐠚𐠬𐠣\udc1b\udc37 \udc1b\udc31𐠐\ud802𐠃\udc2d\udc0b\udc03𐠨\udc13𐠮\udc03\udc33𐠧\udc17𐠁\udc3f\ud802𐠯𐠡\ud802\ud802𐠃\udc13𐠈\udc02\udc21\udc2a\ud802\ud802𐠝\udc27𐠈\udc32𐠨\udc1f</div>"},{"id":"marker250","name":"Crenilneton Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༰༪༌༥༥༸༒༈༸༚༹༈༳༑༬༶༽༽༹༴་༦༗༣༃་༐༨༾༠༺༑༾༬༶༗༣༯༭༸༬༽༮༭༔༽༘༣༐༡༖༨༖༊༻༷༒༠༜༑་༦༌༥༺༭༮༼</div>"},{"id":"marker251","name":"Narbilndus Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ኀፐኀቀጸደወደለረ ተደከቀለከቀ  ደ ጠወጠበለጸ የኀነዐጰፈመዘሰፀ ረጰመሀየየከፈተገረሐሐበገለዐኀለጠቀ ጠቀፀበሐፐሠኀጰፐ ገነየ  ነገጠዐደ </div>"},{"id":"marker252","name":"Srokhazdin Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡠᠵ᠐ᠮᡓᡱᡑᢜᡟᡏᢑ᠀ᠭᡁ᠐ᡱᡔᢠᠽᢓᢐᠮᡲᢟᠵᠽᡞᢠᢡᡯᠾᡳᠡᠠᡏᡒᡡᡁᠽᢤᠰᡕᠿᠮᡑᡀᢂᡯᠡᠻᡮᡰᠠ᠒ᠪᢞᡁᡴᡯᡴᠰᡗᡲᡞᠳᢀᡙᢋᡠᠱᢏᢢ᠑ᠿᡗᡯᡰᡯᡑᢢᡏᡰᡆᡔᢓᢒᡔ</div>"},{"id":"marker253","name":"Brample Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠥𐠨\udc33\ud802\ud802𐠬𐠧\udc31\ud802𐠵𐠎𐠅𐠞\udc2f\udc20\ud802\ud802𐠡\ud802\ud802𐠗\ud802\ud802𐠨\udc12𐠗\ud802\ud802𐠕\udc05\ud802\ud802𐠍\udc37\udc03𐠅𐠫\udc0a𐠸\udc22𐠳\udc2b𐠍\udc1f\udc05\udc3f