=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠽᡭᡎᠭᢞᠾᡙᢠᡡᠮᠿᠠᠧᡐᡳᠽᡖᠦᠪᡝᡐᡳᡲᠦᡕᡓᡖᠱᢒᠦᡞᡍ᠒ᠯᢏᠽᢋᡠᢤᡖᡕᡀᠵᡏᡜᢦᠧᠧᠭᡠᠾᡍᠾᡔᢤ᠀ᡐᠵ᠒ᡴᡍᠭᠮᡁᡆᠲᢡ᠀ᡔᡐᡭᡰᡕᢦᢜᡙᡒᠲᡆᠰᠨᡔᡔᠿᠦ</div>"},{"id":"marker260","name":"Newbore Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> Ⳇ ⲶⳘⳁ ⳢⳔⳤⳫⳁⳲⳁ Ⲽ⳧ⳲⳞⳆⳃⲶⳲⳚ ⳌⲼ⳹ⳖⲶⳎⲲⳆⳤ Ⳇ ⳊⳬⳬⳁⳤⳃⳁⲴⳆⳃ⳾ⳁⳃ ⳪ⳜⳆⲶⳘⲴⲾ⳹Ⳁⳁ⳥ⳒⳤⳞⳎⲲⲴ⳩ⲲⳞ⳩</div>"},{"id":"marker261","name":"Nin'kas Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༡༜༾༁༮༊༶༚༅༮༢༽༫༠༲༽༛༗༒༳༌༁༒༊༯༱༘༲༆༪༸༧༒༴༊༭༱༸༼༼་༄༕༁༅༵༄༙༩༫༓ༀ༹༕༕༵༰༺༕༕༔༣༪༵༴༯༵༧༦༲༊༜ༀ༠༔༖༉༷༨༊༹༑༥༈༵༧༣༕༳༗༑༧༨༇༥</div>"},{"id":"marker262","name":"Ulbgar Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༾༴༻༱་༽༿༾༿༻༣༱༛༊༵༳༛༲༱༆༊༐༢༪༔༴༦༕༄༴༲༊༊༄༾༄༃༰༫༚༡༢༬༻༐༇༊༘༲༛༪༽༚༯༚༡༳༔༗༿༯༠༃༔༩༊༺</div>"},{"id":"marker263","name":"Khargatharb Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳥Ⳓ ⳊⳭⳊⲶⲺⳐⳐⳢⳎ⳾ⳢⳭⳀⳫⳠⳬⲴⳀⳬ ⲶⳌⳊⳫⳫⳫⳠⳠⳃ⳪⳩⳾ⳊⳀⳤⳢⳃⳢⳈⳠⳜⳌⳀⳎⳂ  ⳞⳚⳢⳃⳬⲸⲼ ⳘⲲ</div>"},{"id":"marker264","name":"Ostomerley Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠒\udc17𐠥\udc1b \udc08\ud802\ud802𐠱\udc14\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠧\udc04𐠴\ud802𐠲\udc2a\udc21\udc26\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠯\udc0b\udc13𐠚\udc32𐠦\udc1e\udc15\udc11\udc02𐠟𐠣\udc01𐠮\udc05\udc1e\ud802\ud802𐠊\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷\ud802𐠁𐠩 \udc14\udc1e\udc0a\udc0b\ud802𐠜𐠏\udc10\udc1f\ud802𐠳\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠱\udc23\udc13 \ud802𐠃\udc03</div>"},{"id":"marker265","name":"Ibrolgag Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳅ⳩⳹Ⳉ⳥ⳀⳆⳔⳤ ⳒⲺ⳧ⲺⳠⳆ⳩ⲴⳊⳠ⳾ⳤⲲ ⳚⳂⲲⳬⳠⳚⳠⳖⳫⳢ⳹